{"id":"hoja","lemma":"hoja","pos":"noun","rank":2318,"glosses":["leaf (usually green and flat organ that is the most prominent feature of most vegetative plants)","petal (often brightly coloured component of the corolla of a flower)","blade (narrow leaf of a grass or cereal)"],"ipa":"/ˈoxa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"hojas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-hoja.wav","examples":[{"text":"Dame una hoja de papel.","en":"Give me a sheet of paper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39945","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]},{"text":"Han caído todas las hojas.","en":"All the leaves have fallen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/765650","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"fallen"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Ya no hay vuelta de hoja.","en":"There's no turning back now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568560","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"turn"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"no longer"]]},{"text":"Ella me dio una hoja de papel.","en":"She handed me a sheet of paper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645428","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]},{"text":"Cayeron todas las hojas del árbol.","en":"The tree's leaves have all fallen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587401","words":[{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tree"}]}]}